// EUC-KR HTML 디코딩 → 청약일정 표 파싱 → 이번 주(월~일) 청약 종목 우선, 부족하면 다음 예정 종목으로 채워 최대 10개
const buf = await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'data');
const html = new TextDecoder('euc-kr').decode(buf);

const strip = s => s.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ').replace(/&amp;/g, '&').replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
const rows = [...html.matchAll(/<tr[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/tr>/g)].map(m => m[1]);

const list = [];
for (const r of rows) {
  const tds = [...r.matchAll(/<td[^>]*>([\s\S]*?)<\/td>/g)].map(m => m[1]);
  if (tds.length < 6) continue;
  const date = strip(tds[1]);
  const m = date.match(/^(\d{4})\.(\d{2})\.(\d{2})~(\d{2})\.(\d{2})$/);
  if (!m) continue;
  const y = +m[1];
  const start = new Date(Date.UTC(y, +m[2] - 1, +m[3]));
  let end = new Date(Date.UTC(y, +m[4] - 1, +m[5]));
  if (end < start) end = new Date(Date.UTC(y + 1, +m[4] - 1, +m[5]));
  const noM = tds[0].match(/no=(\d+)/);
  list.push({
    name: strip(tds[0]),
    start, end,
    period: `${+m[2]}/${+m[3]}~${+m[4]}/${+m[5]}`,
    fixedPrice: strip(tds[2]).replace(/^-$/, ''),
    bandPrice: strip(tds[3]),
    competition: strip(tds[4]),
    underwriter: strip(tds[5]),
    link: noM ? `https://www.38.co.kr/html/fund/?o=v&no=${noM[1]}` : ''
  });
}
if (!list.length) throw new Error('38커뮤니케이션 청약일정 파싱 실패 (페이지 구조 변경 가능성)');

// KST 기준 이번 주 월~일
const now = $now.setZone('Asia/Seoul');
const today = new Date(Date.UTC(now.year, now.month - 1, now.day));
const mon = new Date(today); mon.setUTCDate(today.getUTCDate() - (now.weekday - 1));
const sun = new Date(mon); sun.setUTCDate(mon.getUTCDate() + 6);
const md = d => `${d.getUTCMonth() + 1}/${d.getUTCDate()}`;

const thisWeek = list.filter(x => x.start <= sun && x.end >= mon).sort((a, b) => a.start - b.start);
const upcoming = list.filter(x => x.start > sun).sort((a, b) => a.start - b.start);
const picked = [
  ...thisWeek.map(x => ({ ...x, tag: '이번주' })),
  ...upcoming.map(x => ({ ...x, tag: '예정' }))
].slice(0, 10);

const short = s => s.split(',')[0].replace(/증권|투자증권|금융투자/g, '');
const lines = picked.map((x, i) => {
  const status = x.end < today ? '마감' : (x.start <= today ? '청약중' : '');
  const price = x.fixedPrice ? `확정 ${x.fixedPrice}` : x.bandPrice;
  return `${i + 1}. ${x.name} ${x.period}${status ? '(' + status + ')' : ''} ${price} ${short(x.underwriter)}`;
});

const header = `📈 국내 공모주 청약 (${md(mon)}~${md(sun)})\n이번주 ${thisWeek.length}건 + 예정 ${picked.length - Math.min(thisWeek.length, 10)}건`;

// 카카오 텍스트 템플릿은 200자 제한 → 줄 단위로 나눠 여러 메시지로 발송
const LIMIT = 190;
const chunks = [];
let cur = header;
for (const l of lines) {
  if ((cur + '\n' + l).length > LIMIT) { chunks.push(cur); cur = l; }
  else cur += '\n' + l;
}
chunks.push(cur);

return chunks.map((text, i) => ({ json: {
  text: chunks.length > 1 ? `${text}\n(${i + 1}/${chunks.length})`.slice(0, 200) : text,
  link: 'https://www.38.co.kr/html/fund/index.htm?o=k'
} }));

